<blockquote class="uncited"><div>So I have the TYT UV390 Plus GPS and the MD-9600. When I TX on DMR to my MMDVM Hotspot I get a TX Timeout and the MMDVM does not receive it. Same Channel settings and Color Codes on time slots as my Anytone 878 and that works. I searched the forum for an hore and found nothing on this.<br><br>Thanks in advance!</div></blockquote>MMDVM HS hotspots are very sensitive to frequency. I presume you calibrated the hotspot to work with your Anytone<br><br>For people with more than one radio, the only option is to calibrate all the radios to exactly the same frequency<br><br>So adjust the freq cal in both your UV390 and MD9600 to exactly the same as the anytone, to an accuracy of a about +/- 100Hz<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Fri Aug 09, 2024 8:28 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
